# ::tok The first character of a four - byte character is encoded in the range 0x 81-0 xFE ; the second character is encoded in the range 0x 30-0 x39 ; the third character is encoded in the range 0x 81-0 xFE ; and the fourth character is encoded in the range 0x 30-0 x39 . That is : 0x 81308130-0 x 81308139 ; 0x 81308230-0 x 81308239 0x 8130 FEFE 30-0 x 8130 FE39 ; 0x 81318130-0 x 813139 ; Oo2douolag0c " 0URo 23061393 0xFE39FE 30-0 xFE39FE39 .
