# ::tok According to the report , the content ecology of the e - commerce industry is a comprehensive concept , is the integration of e - commerce and content , but not all content can be integrated with e - commerce , good PGC ( professionally produced content ) and UGC ( user - original content ) is a high - quality carrier for integration with e - commerce , the higher the value of the content platform , the richer the consumption and promotion scenarios , the higher the possibility of e - commerce implantation , the stronger the commercial value , the higher the proportion of e - commerce content production and content consumption that is gradually integrated and distributed in the public and private spheres .
