# ::tok The 100 - member large - scale delegation from Hong Kong included leading executives of relevant tourism departments of the Hong Kong Government , more than 60 representatives from travel agencies and cross - border transport operators from Hong Kong and Macao , as well as about 30 journalists from travel magazines and newspapers , travel social media , online media representatives and bloggers / internet celebrities , etc. , who visited Macao for exchange and inspection to learn about the latest tourism resources in Macao . The Hong Kong industry and media brought the new game of Macao tourism to Hong Kong residents and visitors to Hong Kong , and took advantage of the advantages of Hong Kong 's transport hub to expand the " online travel " market in Hong Kong and Macao .
