# ::tok First of all , just bought a few days to find a price reduction , bad reviews , this is not bad , cost - effective , cpu and graphics card enough to cope with the mainstream online games and quite a few large stand - alone , cooling is very good , but the screen is a bit light leakage ( ips screen common problem ) , sound quality is not very good , hard disk is not good ( suggest to spend some money to add a solid state ) , yesterday took the after - sales testing of the hardware , there is no problem , comes with win 8.1 is not very easy to use , it is recommended to upgrade to 10 , the seller shipped quickly , all inquiries answered quickly , received the computer the next day the invoice arrived , good , but unfortunately no gifts .
